@WebAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

GET {{WebAPI_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json
###

GET {{WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/v1/quizzes
Accept: application/json
###

GET {{WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/v1/quizzes/1
Accept: application/json


### Wrong id 
GET {{WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/v1/quizzes/10
Accept: application/json

### First answer - Good
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/quizzes/1/items/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "answer": "A"
}


### Second answer - Good
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/quizzes/1/items/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2,
  "answer": "B"
}

### Third answer - Bad
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/quizzes/1/items/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId":3,
  "answer": "H"
}

### Result Check
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/quizzes/1/users/1/result
Accept: application/json